  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1 - Added support for Trailer headers in chunked responses via HttpResponseStream.AddTrailer.\n   2 - Enhanced RFC compliance: implemented leading CRLF skipping and strict validation for header names/folding.\n   3 - Enforced mandatory Content-Length/Transfer-Encoding for POST, PUT, and PATCH requests (411 Length Required).\n   4 - Improved framing security by rejecting requests containing both Content-Length and Transfer-Encoding headers.\n   5 - Expanded test suite to 254 tests covering edge-case RFC compliance and security.\n   6 - Updated documentation and class references for chunked streaming and feature support.",
